@startuml Data Flow Diagram

title Data Flow - Multimodal Fraud Detection Pipeline

skinparam activity {
    BackgroundColor LightBlue
    BorderColor DarkBlue
    ArrowColor Black
}

|Input Sources|
start
:Raw Transaction Data
(CSV/DataFrame);
note right
    **Features:**
    - step
    - type (PAYMENT, TRANSFER, etc.)
    - amount
    - nameOrig
    - oldbalanceOrg
    - newbalanceOrig
    - nameDest
    - oldbalanceDest
    - newbalanceDest
    - isFlaggedFraud
    - isFraud (label)
end note

:Raw QR Code Images
(PNG/JPG files);
note right
    **Characteristics:**
    - Variable sizes
    - RGB format
    - Benign/Malicious
    - Directory structure
end note

|Tabular Processing|
:FraudDataPreprocessor|

:Encode categorical features
(type → numeric);

:Drop ID columns
(nameOrig, nameDest);

:Standardize numerical features
(StandardScaler);

:Reshape for transformer
(batch, seq_len, features);

:Processed Tabular Data
[batch, 1, 8];
note right
    **8 Features:**
    1. step
    2. type (encoded)
    3. amount (scaled)
    4. oldbalanceOrg (scaled)
    5. newbalanceOrig (scaled)
    6. oldbalanceDest (scaled)
    7. newbalanceDest (scaled)
    8. isFlaggedFraud
end note

|Image Processing|
:QRCodePreprocessor|

:Load/Resize images
to (128, 128, 3);

:Normalize pixel values
to [0, 1];

:Processed Image Data
[batch, 128, 128, 3];

|Multimodal Integration|
:MultimodalDataPreprocessor|

:Align samples
(ensure same count);

:Create train/test split
(80/20);

split
    :Training Set
    - X_train_tabular
    - X_train_images
    - y_train;
split again
    :Test Set
    - X_test_tabular
    - X_test_images
    - y_test;
end split

|Model Encoding|
fork
    :Tabular Branch|
    
    :Feature Embedding
    [batch, 1, 64];
    
    :Positional Encoding;
    
    :Transformer Blocks (×2)
    - MultiHeadSelfAttention
    - FeedForward
    - Residual Connections;
    
    :Tabular Features
    [batch, 1, 64];
    
fork again
    :Image Branch|
    
    :Patch Embedding
    16×16 patches → 64 patches;
    
    :Linear Projection
    [batch, 64, 64];
    
    :Positional Encoding;
    
    :Transformer Blocks (×2)
    - MultiHeadSelfAttention
    - FeedForward
    - Residual Connections;
    
    :Image Features
    [batch, 64, 64];
end fork

|Cross-Modal Fusion|
:Cross-Modal Transformer Blocks (×2)|

:CrossModalAttention
Tabular → Image
(Q from tab, K,V from img);

:CrossModalAttention
Image → Tabular
(Q from img, K,V from tab);

:FeedForward Networks
for both modalities;

fork
    :Enhanced Tabular
    [batch, 1, 64];
fork again
    :Enhanced Image
    [batch, 64, 64];
end fork

|Classification|
:Concatenate or Pool
features;

:Global Average Pooling;

:Dense Layer (128)
+ ReLU + Dropout;

:Dense Layer (64)
+ ReLU + Dropout;

:Dense Layer (1)
+ Sigmoid;

:Fraud Probability
[batch, 1];
note right
    **Output:**
    - Value in [0, 1]
    - Threshold: 0.5
    - > 0.5 = Fraud
    - ≤ 0.5 = Normal
end note

|Output|
if (Fraud Probability > 0.5?) then (yes)
    #pink:Predict: FRAUD;
else (no)
    #lightgreen:Predict: NORMAL;
endif

note right
    **Data Dimensions Throughout Pipeline:**
    
    Tabular: [batch, 1, 8] → [batch, 1, 64] → [batch, 1, 64]
    Image: [batch, 128, 128, 3] → [batch, 64, 64] → [batch, 64, 64]
    Output: [batch, 1]
end note

stop

@enduml
